170
00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:19.546
Great.

171
00:11:20.048 --> 00:11:21.048
Cool.

172
00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:23.419
Love you.

173
00:12:21.103 --> 00:12:22.472
Aren't you sick of this?

174
00:12:24.173 --> 00:12:25.940
